{'symbol': 'CPB', 'date': '2023-01-31 08:30:00', 'title': 'CAMPBELL NAMED TO 2023 BLOOMBERG GENDER-EQUALITY INDEX', 'text': 'CAMDEN, N.J.--( BUSINESS WIRE )--CAMPBELL SOUP COMPANY (NYSE:CPB) TODAY WAS NAMED TO THE 2023 BLOOMBERG GENDER-EQUALITY INDEX (GEI), WHICH TRACKS THE PERFORMANCE OF PUBLIC COMPANIES COMMITTED TO TRANSPARENCY IN GENDER-DATA REPORTING. THE GEI MEASURES GENDER EQUALITY ACROSS FIVE PILLARS: FEMALE LEADERSHIP AND TALENT PIPELINE, EQUAL PAY AND GENDER PAY PARITY, INCLUSIVE CULTURE, ANTI-SEXUAL HARASSMENT POLICIES AND PRO-WOMEN BRAND.'}